OL,3,GNEWSATen men deny killing football fan
OL,4,Aby manslaughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen men have denied killing a Cambridge
OL,7,FUnited fan by manslaughter after a
OL,8,Ffootball match.
OL,10,FSimon Dobbin was seriously injured
OL,11,Foutside a pub after the U's drew 0-0 at
OL,12,FSouthend United on 21 March 2015.
OL,14,FThe dad, from Mildenhall, Suffolk, was
OL,15,Fleft permanently brain-damaged and died
OL,16,Ffrom his injuries in October 2020, aged
OL,17,F48.
OL,19,FThe defendants, aged between 30 and 50,
OL,20,Fentered their pleas at Basildon Crown
OL,21,FCourt and will stand trial on 5 April.
